BT 1 0 0 1 0 33 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 1.441924 Tw (Performance optimization in low-code applications means designing forms, workflows and scripts so that) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.75777 Tw (they use data and processing only as far as needed. Although a low-code platform handles much of the) Tj T* 0 Tw (underlying work, the way in which a workflow is written still influences how efficiently it runs.) Tj T* ET
