BT 1 0 0 1 0 62 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 1.623939 Tw (Retrieving more records than required, or repeatedly processing records that are not relevant to the task,) Tj T* 0 Tw .127799 Tw (causes unnecessary data retrieval and processing. In a small application this may not be noticeable, but as the) Tj T* 0 Tw .282739 Tw (number of records and users grows it can reduce application efficiency. Efficient workflows in Zoho Creator) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.406935 Tw (therefore retrieve only the data they need and avoid unnecessary processing, which supports scalable and) Tj T* 0 Tw (maintainable applications.) Tj T* ET
